  "resume": "This is a 1985 Swiss TV news report from Tagesschau covering the controversy surrounding the construction of the A4 motorway in the Knonauer Amt region of Zurich. It shows landscape impressions, a map of the planned highway section, and protests by farmers with cows and a \"N4-NIE\" banner against the project in Zurich. The report also includes footage of the cantonal council session regarding the TCS's popular initiative."
